# Class: obo:FOODON_00002452 (invertebrate animal)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:FOODON_00002452 "Familiar examples of invertebrates include arthropods (insects, arachnids, crustaceans, and myriapods), mollusks (chitons, snails, bivalves, squids, and octopuses), annelids (earthworms and leeches), and cnidarians (hydras, jellyfishes, sea anemones, and corals).[wikipedia]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002452 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002452 "Invertebrates are animals that neither possess nor develop a vertebral column (commonly known as a backbone or spine), derived from the notochord. This includes all animals apart from the subphylum Vertebrata."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00002452 "Damion Dooley"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00002452 "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invertebrate"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00002452 "invertebrate animal"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00002452 obo:FOODON_00003004)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00002452 obo:FOODON_00005522)

# Class: obo:FOODON_00002454 (food material by characteristic)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002454 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002454 "Food material which has been categorized by a characteristic such as granularity or temperature."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00002454 "Damion Dooley"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_00002454 "This term was renamed from \"food product by quality\" to align better with COB \"characteristic\" label, and as well to disambiguate from other use of \"quality\" as a food grading. This term is useful for tasks like food inspection where little prior knowledge of how the food came to be is available. Some terms like \"food (frozen)\"are both a quality descriptor and the output of a process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00002454 "food material by characteristic"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00002454 obo:FOODON_00002403)

