# Class: obo:FOODON_00002531 (cattle steer)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002531 "A cattle steer is an adult castrated male of a cattle species."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00002531 "Damion Dooley")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00002531 "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle#Terminology"@en)
