# Class: obo:FOODON_00002895 (kratom)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002895 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002895 "Kratom  (Mitragyna speciosa) is a tropical evergreen tree in the coffee family native to Southeast Asia. M. speciosa is indigenous to Thailand, Indonesia, Malaysia, Myanmar, and Papua New Guinea, where it has been used in traditional medicines since at least the nineteenth century. Kratom has opioid properties and some stimulant-like effects."@en)
