AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002901 "Golden pompanos are fairly deep bodied ocean fish of family Carangidae, and are prized eating fish worldwide. They can be distinguished from other pompanos by their slightly longer dorsal fin."@en)
