# Class: obo:FOODON_00002904 (roter fusilier)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002904 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002904 "The Roter Fusilier is a type of fish from the fusilier family, Caesionidae, in the order Perciformes. They are related to the snappers, but adapted for feeding on plankton, rather than on larger prey. They are found at reefs in the Indo-Pacific."@en)
