AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002907 "The walking catfish (Clarias batrachus) is a species of freshwater airbreathing catfish native to Southeast Asia. It is named for its ability to \"walk\" and wiggle across dry land, to find food or suitable environments."@en)
