# Class: obo:FOODON_00002955 (lemur)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002955 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002955 "Lemurs are mammals of the order Primates, divided into 8 families and consisting of 15 genera and around 100 existing species. They are native only to the island of Madagascar. Most existing lemurs are small, have a pointed snout, large eyes, and a long tail. They chiefly live in trees (arboreal), and are active at night (nocturnal)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00002955 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00002955 "Emma Griffiths"@en)
