# Class: obo:FOODON_00003229 (absinthe)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00003229 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00003229 "A distilled, highly alcoholic beverage (45–74% ABV / 90–148 U.S. proof). It is an anise-flavoured spirit derived from botanicals, including the flowers and leaves of Artemisia absinthium (\"grand wormwood\"), together with green anise, sweet fennel, and other medicinal and culinary herbs."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00003229 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00003229 wikipedia:Absinthe)
