AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00003275 "A coffee-flavoured Italian dessert made of ladyfingers (savoiardi) dipped in coffee, layered with a whipped mixture of eggs, sugar, and mascarpone cheese, flavoured with cocoa."@en)
