# Class: obo:FOODON_00003276 (red velvet cake)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00003276 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00003276 "Red velvet cake is traditionally a red, red-brown, crimson or scarlet colored chocolate layer cake, layered with white cream cheese or ermine icing. Traditional recipes do not use food coloring, with the red color due to non-Dutched, anthocyanin-rich cocoa."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_00003276 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
