# Class: obo:FOODON_00004475 (clown featherback)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00004475 "The clown featherback, clown knifefish, or spotted knifefish, Chitala ornata, is a nocturnal tropical fish with a long, knife-like body. This knifefish is native to freshwater habitats in Cambodia, Laos, Thailand and Vietnam, but it has also been introduced to regions outside its native range. It is one of world's most invasive species."@en)
