# Class: obo:FOODON_03411010 (neogastropod)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411010 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411010 "Neogastropoda is a taxonomic order of sea snails, marine gastropod mollusks. *Neogastropoda* includes many well-known gastropods including the cone snails, conchs, mud snails, olive snails, oyster drills, tulip shells, and whelks. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neogastropoda]"@en)
