# Class: obo:FOODON_03411059 (shellfish or crustacean)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411059 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411059 "Shellfish is a food source and fisheries term for exoskeleton-bearing aquatic invertebrates used as food, including various species of molluscs, crustaceans, and echinoderms. Although most kinds of shellfish are harvested from saltwater environments, some kinds are found in freshwater. In addition, a few species of land crabs are eaten, for example *Cardisoma guanhumi* in the Caribbean. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shellfish]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411059 langual:B1059)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03411059 "This is equivalent to:

'crustacean (food source)' or 'shellfish (food source)'

However, this has not been implemented due to reasoner performance on FoodOn."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03411059 "shellfish or crustacean"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411059 obo:FOODON_00002581)

