AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411063 "A boysenberry is a cross between a European Raspberry (*Rubus idaeus*), a Common Blackberry (*Rubus fruticosus*), and a Loganberry (*Rubus × loganobaccus*) ."@en)
