# Class: obo:FOODON_03411079 (durum wheat plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411079 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411079 "Durum wheat, also called pasta wheat or macaroni wheat (Triticum durum or Triticum turgidum subsp. durum),[4] is a tetraploid species of wheat. It is the second most cultivated species of wheat after common wheat, although it represents only 5% to 8% of global wheat production."@en)
