AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411082 "Lepidium campestre (field pepperwort or field pepperweed) is an annual plant in the *Brassicaceae* or mustard family, native to Europe, but commonly found in North America as an invasive weed.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lepidium_campestre]"@en)
