# Class: obo:FOODON_03411086 (sicyoniid shrimp family)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411086 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411086 "Sicyonia is a genus of prawns, placed in its own family, *Sicyoniidae*. It differs from other prawns in that the last three pairs of its pleopods are uniramous, rather than biramous as seen in all other prawns. Sicyonia contains 52 extant species [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sicyonia]"@en)
