AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411199 "Thyme is an aromatic perennial evergreen herb with culinary, medicinal, and ornamental uses. The most common variety is *Thymus vulgaris*. Thyme is of the genus Thymus of the mint family (*Lamiaceae*), and a relative of the oregano genus *Origanum*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thyme]"@en)
