AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411245 "An apple tree (Malus pumila species in genus Malus), is cultivated worldwide as a fruit tree, providing sweet, edible fruit.  Malus pumila encompasses over 7,500 apple cultivars (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_apple_cultivars)."@en)
