# Class: obo:FOODON_03411329 (grape cultivar)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411329 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411329 "Vitis (grapevines) is a genus of 79 accepted species of vining plants in the flowering plant family *Vitaceae*. The genus is made up of species predominantly from the Northern hemisphere. It is economically important as the source of grapes, both for direct consumption of the fruit and for fermentation to produce wine. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitis]"@en)
