# Class: obo:FOODON_03411449 (peppermint plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411449 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411449 "Peppermint (*Mentha × piperita*, also known as *Mentha balsamea* Wild.) is a hybrid mint, a cross between watermint and spearmint. Indigenous to Europe and the Middle East, the plant is now widely spread and cultivated in many regions of the world. It is occasionally found in the wild with its parent species. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peppermint]"@en)
