# Class: obo:FOODON_03411462 (zucchini plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411462 "The zucchini or courgette is a summer squash which can reach nearly a meter in length, but which is usually harvested at half that size or less. Along with certain other squashes, it belongs to the species Cucurbita pepo. Zucchini can be dark or light green. A related hybrid, the golden zucchini, is a deep yellow or orange color."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03411462 wikipedia:Zucchini)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411462 langual:B1462)
