SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411462 obo:FOODON_03411006)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411462 obo:NCBITaxon_3663)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03411463 (brazil nut plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411463 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411463 "The Brazil nut (*Bertholletia excelsa*) is a South American tree in the family Lecythidaceae, and also the name of the tree's commercially harvested edible seed. While cooks classify the Brazil nut as a nut, botanists consider it to be a seed and not a nut, because in nuts the shell splits in half with the meat separate from the shell."@en)
