# Class: obo:FOODON_03411578 (santa claus melon plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411578 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411578 "The Santa Claus melon, sometimes known as Christmas melon or Piel de Sapo, is a variety of melon that grows to approximately 1 foot in length and is oblong in shape. It has a thick outer green-striped rind with a pale green inner pulp that provides a mild melon flavor, that can be as sweet as honeydew melons, if not more so."@en)
