AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411596 "Pinus pinea has been cultivated extensively for at least 6,000 years for the edible pine nuts. These have been trade items since early historic times. This cultivation throughout the Mediterranean region for so long that it has naturalized and is often considered native beyond its natural range."@en)
