# Class: obo:FOODON_03411894 (semionotiformes fish)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411894 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411894 "Semionotiformes (\"flag-back form\") is an order of primitive, ray-finned, primarily freshwater fish from the Triassic to the Cretaceous. The best-known genus is *Semionotus* of Europe and North America. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semionotiformes]"@en)
