AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411895 "The Zeiformes are a small order of marine ray-finned fishes most notable for the dories, a group of common food fish. The order consists of about 33 species in seven families, mostly deep-sea types. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zeiformes]"@en)
