AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412215 "Mud crab may refer to any crab that lives in or near mud, such as: species from family *Portunidae*, such as *Scylla serrata*; *Scylla tranquebarica*; *Scylla paramamosain*; members of the family *Panopeidae*, such as *Panopeus herbstii*; members of the family *Xanthidae*; *Helice crassa*, the tunnelling mud crab. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mud_crab]"@en)
