# Class: obo:FOODON_03412400 (arrowroot plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412400 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412400 "Arrowroot, any of several species of the genus *Maranta*, members of the family *Marantaceae*, the rhizomes, or rootstocks, of which yield an edible starch. The most commonly used species is *Maranta arundinacea*, the source of genuine, or West Indies, arrowroot. [https://global.britannica.com/plant/arrowroot]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412400 <http://eol.org/pages/1116525>)
