AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412450 "Bracken (*Pteridium*) is a genus of large, coarse ferns in the family *Dennstaedtiaceae*. *Pteridium aquilinum* (bracken or common bracken) is the most common species with a cosmopolitan distribution, occurring in temperate and subtropical regions throughout much of the world. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bracken]"@en)
