# Class: obo:FOODON_03412553 (lamniform fish)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412553 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412553 "The Lamniformes are an order of sharks commonly known as mackerel sharks (which may also refer specifically to the family *Lamnidae*). It includes some of the most familiar species of sharks, such as the great white and extinct megalodon, as well as more unusual representatives, such as the goblin shark and megamouth shark. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamniformes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412553 <http://eol.org/pages/1874>)
