AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412555 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412555 "The habanero chili was disseminated by Spanish colonists to other areas of the world, to the point that 18th-century taxonomists mistook China for its place of origin and called it *Capsicum chinense* (\"the Chinese pepper\"). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Habanero]"@en)
