AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412628 "The bell pepper (also known as sweet pepper or pepper in the United Kingdom, Canada and Ireland, and capsicum in Australia, India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Singapore and New Zealand) is a cultivar group of the species *Capsicum annuum*. Bell peppers are sometimes grouped with less pungent pepper varieties as \"sweet peppers\". [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_pepper]"@en)
