# Class: obo:FOODON_03412743 (chickasaw plum plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412743 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412743 "Prunus angustifolia, known commonly as Chickasaw plum, Cherokee plum, Florida sand plum, sandhill plum, or sand plum, is a North American species of plum-bearing tree. It was originally cultivated by Native Americans before the arrival of Europeans.  While *Prunus* is the classical name for European plums, *angustifolia* refers to its narrow leaves. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prunus_angustifolia]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412743 <http://eol.org/pages/231184>)
