# Class: obo:FOODON_03412940 (red beet plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412940 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412940 "The beetroot, also known as the table beet, garden beet, red beet or informally simply as beet, is one of the many cultivated varieties of beets (*Beta vulgaris*) and arguably the most commonly encountered variety in North America, Central America and Britain."@en)
