# Class: obo:FOODON_03412945 (scurvy-grass plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412945 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412945 "Scurvy-grass (*Cochlearia* species; a.k.a. Scurvy grass, Scurvygrass, or Spoonwort) is a genus of about 30 species of annual and perennial herbs in the cabbage family *Brassicaceae*. They are widely distributed in temperate and arctic areas of the northern hemisphere, most commonly found in coastal regions, on cliff-tops and salt marshes where their high tolerance of salt enables them to avoid competition from larger, but less salt-tolerant plants; they also occur in alpine habitats in mountains and tundra.
 
Scurvy-grass was extensively eaten in the past by sailors suffering from scurvy after returning from long voyages, as the leaves are rich in vitamin C, which cures this deficiency disease resulting from a lack of fresh vegetables in the diet. The leaves, which have a strong peppery taste similar to the related horseradish and watercress, are also sometimes used in salads."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 <http://eol.org/pages/584102>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?11010>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=22816>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 langual:B2945)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 "MANSFELD:23616")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412945 "PLANTS:COOF4")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FOODON_03412945 "scurvy-grass")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FOODON_03412945 "spoonwort")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412945 "cochlearia officinalis"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412945 "scurvygrass"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412945 "spoonwort"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03412945 "scurvy-grass plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412945 obo:FOODON_03411566)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412945 obo:FOODON_03413372)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412945 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_270110))

# Class: obo:FOODON_03412946 (cornelian cherry plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412946 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412946 "Cornus mas (Cornelian cherry, European cornel or Cornelian cherry dogwood) is a species of flowering plant in the dogwood family *Cornaceae* native to Southern Europe and Southwestern Asia. 
 The fruits when ripe on the plant bear a resemblance to coffee berries, and ripen in mid- to late summer. The fruit is edible (mainly consumed in Eastern Europe, UK, and Iran), but the unripe fruit is astringent. The fruit only fully ripens after it falls from the tree. When ripe, the fruit is dark ruby red or a bright yellow. It has an acidic flavour which is best described as a mixture of cranberry and sour cherry; it is mainly used for making jam, makes an excellent sauce similar to cranberry sauce when pitted and then boiled with sugar and orange, but also can be eaten dried.  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cornus_mas]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 <http://eol.org/pages/591119>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?11563>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=565094>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 langual:B2946)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 "MANSFELD:24774")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412946 "PLANTS:COMA21")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FOODON_03412946 "cornelian cherry")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412946 "cornus mas"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03412946 "cornelian cherry plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412946 obo:FOODON_03411539)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412946 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_4285))

