AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03413489 "Vaccinium parvifolium (Red Huckleberry) is a species of *Vaccinium* native to the Pacific Northwest of North America. Indigenous peoples found the plant and its fruit very useful. The bright red, acidic berries were used extensively for food throughout the year."@en)
