AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03413717 "A member of the family *Chenopodiaceae*, and is the wild ancestor of common vegetables such as beetroot, sugar beet, and Swiss chard. Its leaves have a pleasant texture and taste when served raw or cooked."@en)
