AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414206 "The blackberry is an edible fruit produced by any of several species in the *Rubus* genus of the *Rosaceae* family. The fruit is not a true berry; botanically it is termed an aggregate fruit, composed of small drupelets."@en)
