# Class: obo:FOODON_03414214 (mandarin lime plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414214 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414214 "Rangpur, Citrus × limonia, also known as lemandarin, is a hybrid between the mandarin orange and the lemon. It is a citrus fruit with a very acidic taste and an orange peel and flesh."@en)
