# Class: obo:FOODON_03414273 (potassium hydrogen tartrate)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414273 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414273 "Potassium hydrogen tartrate, also known as potassium bitartrate, has formula KC4H5O6, is a byproduct of winemaking. In cooking it is known as cream of tartar. It is the potassium acid salt of tartaric acid."@en)
