# Class: obo:FOODON_03414275 (splendid alfonsino)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414275 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414275 "The splendid alfonsino, *Beryx splendens*, is an alfonsino of the genus *Beryx*, found around the world at depths of between 25 and 1,300 m. Their length is between 30 and 70 cm. It is known as kinmedai in sushi and Japanese cuisine."@en)
