# Class: obo:FOODON_03414286 (ridge scaled rattail)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414286 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414286 "The ridge scaled rattail, *Macrourus carinatus*, is a rattail of the genus *Macrourus*, found in the Great Southern Ocean at depths of between 200 and 1,200 m. Its length is between 30 to 65 cm, although Fishbase records lengths up to 1 m."@en)
