# Class: obo:FOODON_03414288 (odacidae)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414288 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414288 "Odacidae is a small family of fishes in the order *Perciformes*, commonly known as butterfish, cales, and weed-whitings. They are related to the much larger families of the wrasses and parrotfish."@en)
