AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414356 "Vaccinium virgatum (commonly known as either rabbit-eye blueberry or southern black blueberry) is a species of blueberry native to the Southeastern United States, from North Carolina south to Florida and west to Texas."@en)
