# Class: obo:FOODON_03414357 (sorbus plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414357 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414357 "Sorbus is a genus of about 100 - 200 species of trees and shrubs in the Rose family, *Rosaceae*. Species of *Sorbus* (s.l.) are commonly known as whitebeam, rowan, service tree, and mountain-ash."@en)
