AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414513 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414513 "Cycas rumphii, commonly known as queen sago or the queen sago palm, is a dioecious gymnosperm, a species of cycad in the genus *Cycas* native to Indonesia, New Guinea and Christmas Island. Although palm-like in appearance, it is not a palm."@en)
