AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414525 "American ginseng (*Panax quinquefolius*) is a herbaceous perennial plant in the ivy family, commonly used as Chinese or herbal medicine. An extract is sold as Cold-fX. It is native to eastern North America, though it is also cultivated in places such as China."@en)
