# Class: obo:FOODON_03414531 (atlantic bobtail)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414531 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414531 "Sepiola atlantica, also known as the Atlantic bobtail, is a species of bobtail squid native to the northeastern Atlantic Ocean (65ºN to 35ºN), from Iceland, the Faroe Islands and western Norway to the Moroccan coast. There is a single record of this species from the Mediterranean Sea."@en)
