# Class: obo:FOODON_03414592 (assai palm plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414592 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414592 "The açaí palm (*Euterpe oleracea*) is a species of palm tree in the genus *Euterpe* cultivated for its fruit and hearts of palm. Global demand for the fruit has expanded rapidly in recent years, and açaí is now cultivated for that purpose primarily. *Euterpe edulis* (juçara) is a closely related species which is now the primary source of hearts of palm.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%C3%A7a%C3%AD_palm]"@en)
