AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414596 "Ascophyllum nodosum is a large, common brown alga (*Phaeophyceae*) in the family *Fucaceae*, being the only species in the genus *Ascophyllum*. It is seaweed of the northern Atlantic Ocean, also known as rockweed, Norwegian kelp, knotted kelp, knotted wrack or egg wrack. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ascophyllu]"@en)
