# Class: obo:FOODON_03414601 (red sea bream)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414601 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414601 "The blackspot seabream (*Pagellus bogaraveo*), also known as the red seabream, is a fish species in *Sparidae* family. It is widespread in the Eastern Atlantic from Norway, Strait of Gibraltar to Cape Blanc in Mauritania, Madeira, Canary Islands, and western Mediterranean; it has been also reported from Iceland.  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackspot_seabream]"@en)
