AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414608 "The blue shark (*Prionace glauca*) is a species of requiem shark, in the family *Carcharhinidae*, that inhabits deep waters in the world's temperate and tropical oceans. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_shark]"@en)
