AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414618 "The magpie goose (*Anseranas semipalmata*) is the sole living representative waterbird species of the *Anseranatidae* family. It is a resident breeder in northern Australia and a vagrant to southern New Guinea. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magpie_goose]"@en)
