AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414625 "Elseya is a genus of large side-necked turtles, commonly known as Australian snapping turtles, in the family *Chelidae*. Species in the genus *Elseya* are found in river systems in northern and northeastern Australia and throughout the river systems of New Guinea."@en)
