# Class: obo:FOODON_03414650 (cissus grape plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414650 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414650 "Cissus is a genus of approximately 350 species of lianas (woody vines) in the grape family (*Vitaceae)*. They have a cosmopolitan distribution, though the majority are to be found in the tropics. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cissus]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414650 <http://eol.org/pages/61156>)
