# Class: obo:FOODON_03414670 (passionflower plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414670 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414670 "Passiflora, known also as the passion flowers or passion vines, is a genus of about 500 species of flowering plants, the type genus of the family *Passifloraceae*. They are mostly vines, with some being shrubs, and a few species being herbaceous. For information about the fruit of the passiflora plant, see *PASSION FRUIT*.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Passiflora]"@en)
