AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414671 "Persoonia is a genus of 98 species of shrubs and small trees in the subfamily *Persoonioideae* in the large and diverse plant family *Proteaceae*. In the eastern states of Australia, they are commonly known as geebungs, while in Western Australia and South Australia they go by the common name snottygobbles. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persoonia]"@en)
