AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414699 "Nypa fruticans, commonly known as the nipa palm (or simply nipa) or mangrove palm, is a species of palm native to the coastlines and estuarine habitats of the Indian and Pacific Oceans. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nypa_fruticans]"@en)
