AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414763 "Dianella is a monocot genus of flowering plants. They are commonly called flax lilies. *Dianella* ranges from Japan to India, thence south to Australia and New Zealand; it also occurs on many Pacific Islands. About half of the species are native to Australia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dianella_(plant)]"@en)
