AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414770 "Geranium is a genus of 422 species of flowering annual, biennial, and perennial plants that are commonly known as the cranesbills. They are found throughout the temperate regions of the world and the mountains of the tropics, but mostly in the eastern part of the Mediterranean region. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geranium]"@en)
