# Class: obo:FOODON_03414771 (grevillea plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414771 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414771 "Grevillea is a diverse genus of about 360 species of evergreen flowering plants in the family *Proteaceae*, native to rainforest and more open habitats in Australia, New Guinea, New Caledonia, Sulawesi and other Indonesian islands east of the Wallace Line. Grevillea flowers were a traditional favourite among Aborigines for their sweet nectar. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grevillea]"@en)
