AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414774 "Hypoxis is a genus of flowering plants belonging to the family Hypoxidaceae*. Most species are in the Southern Hemisphere, especially in southern Africa. Common names for the genus include star-grass, star lily, yellow stars, African potato, and stars. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypoxis]"@en)
