# Class: obo:FOODON_03414780 (paloverde plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414780 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414780 "Parkinsonia is a genus of flowering plants in the pea family, *Fabaceae*. It contains about 12 species that are native to semi-desert regions of Africa and the Americas. Most American species are known by the common name of palo verde or paloverde, from the Spanish words meaning \"green pole\" or \"green stick\". [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parkinsonia]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414780 <http://eol.org/pages/53527>)
