AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414782 "Caesalpinia is a genus of flowering plants in the legume family, *Fabaceae*. It contains tropical or subtropical woody plants including lianas. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caesalpinia]"@en)
