AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414783 "Randia, commonly known as indigoberry, is a mostly neotropical genus of shrubs or small trees in the *Rubiaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Randia_(plant)]"@en)
