AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414784 "Rhodamnia is a group of rainforest trees and shrubs in the myrtle family described as a genus in 1822. They are native to southern China, Southeast Asia, Papuasia, Australia, and New Caledonia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhodamnia]"@en)
