AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414785 "Rhyncharrhena is a species of plants in the *Apocynaceae* first described as a genus in 1859. It contains only one known species, Rhyncharrhena linearis, native to Australia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhyncharrhena]"@en)
