AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414791 "Trianthema is a genus of flowering plants in the ice plant family, *Aizoaceae*. The genus contains about 20 described species growing in tropical and subtropical regions, especially Australia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trianthema]"@en)
