AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414816 "The bogong moth (*Agrotis infusa*) is a temperate species of night-flying moth, notable for its biannual long-distance seasonal migrations towards and from the Australian Alps, similar to the diurnal monarch butterfly.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bogong_moth]"@en)
