AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414817 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414817 "In Australia larvae of some psyllids, for example *Psylla eucalypti*, hide under a protective shield of crystallized honeydew.In this form it is called lerp or lerp scale. [http://en.foodlexicon.org/h0002600.php]"@en)
