# Class: obo:FOODON_03414823 (green plum plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414823 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414823 "Buchanania obovata is a small to medium-sized understorey tree in woodlands native to northern Australia. Common names include green plum and wild mango. The fruit is traditionally eaten by Aborigines. The plant also has traditional medicinal uses. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buchanania_obovata]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414823 <http://eol.org/pages/4410>)
