AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414839 "Araucaria bidwillii, the bunya pine, is a large evergreen coniferous tree in the plant family *Araucariaceae*. It is found naturally in south-east Queensland Australia and two small disjunct populations in north eastern Queensland's World Heritage listed Wet Tropics.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Araucaria_bidwillii]"@en)
