AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414846 "Actinidia arguta (hardy kiwi) is a perennial vine native to Japan, Korea, Northern China, and Russian Siberia. It produces a small fruit resembling the kiwifruit."@en)
