AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414855 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414855 "A species of freshwater fish, one of several Asian carps. It is one of the most intensively exploited fishes in aquaculture, with an annual worldwide production of over three million tonnes in 2013, principally from China."@en)
