# Class: obo:FOODON_03414861 (clarias catfish)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414861 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414861 "A genus of catfishes (order Siluriformes) of the family Clariidae, the airbreathing catfishes. They are found in inland waters throughout much of the Old World, and are one of the most widespread catfish genera in the world. Many of the species are of great economic importance in both fisheries and fish culture."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03414861 wikipedia:Clarias)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414861 <http://eol.org/pages/5106>)
