AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414863 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414863 "A species of catfish (sheatfish), family Siluridae. It is a large freshwater fish found in continental East Asia and in Japan."@en)
