# Class: obo:FOODON_03414870 (arapaima)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414870 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414870 "A species of arapaima native to the basin of the Amazon River. Once believed to be the sole species in the genus, it is among the largest freshwater fish. The species is an obligate air-breather and needs to come to the surface regularly to gulp air."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414870 <http://eol.org/pages/204868>)
