# Class: obo:FOODON_03414876 (cachama)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414876 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414876 "A large species of freshwater fish in the family Serrasalmidae. It is native to tropical South America, but kept in aquaculture and introduced elsewhere. It is also known by the names black pacu, black-finned pacu, giant pacu, cachama, gamitana, and sometimes as pacu (a name used for several other related species)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414876 <http://eol.org/pages/215393>)
