AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414878 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414878 "A South American ray-finned fish that is native to the Paraguay-Paraná River basin, but it has been introduced by aquaculture activities in a wider area."@en)
