AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414880 "A widely distributed species of sleeper goby native to fresh and brackish waters This species is an economically important fish, being sought after by local commercial fisheries and farmed. It can also be found in the aquarium trade."@en)
