AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414882 "A species of freshwater fish in the *Clupeidae* family which was endemic to Lake Tanganyika but which has now been introduced to other lakes in Africa as a food source. It is monotypic within the genus *Limnothrissa*. It and the Lake Tanganyika sprat are known collectively as kapenta."@en)
