AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414883 "A family of osmeriform fish, related to the smelts. They are found in freshwater environments in East and Southeast Asia, although a few species are anadromous (e.g., *Salangichthys microdon*), spending most of their lives in coastal waters, and only visiting fresh water to spawn."@en)
