# Class: obo:FOODON_03414907 (canary grass plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414907 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414907 "Canary grass is a plant, *Phalaris canariensis*, belonging to the family *Poaceae*. Originally a native of the Mediterranean region, it is now grown commercially in several parts of the world for birdseed. In the Canary Islands, Italy and North Africa, P. canariensis is used as food. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canary_grass]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414907 <http://eol.org/pages/1114733>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414907 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?27517>)
