# Class: obo:FOODON_03414915 (sea lavender plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414915 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414915 "Limonium is a genus of 120 flowering plant species. Members are also known as sea-lavender, statice, caspia or marsh-rosemary. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limonium]"@en)
