# Class: obo:FOODON_03414949 (yellow pitaya plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414949 "Hylocereus megalanthus is a cactus species in the genus *Hylocereus* that is native to northern South America, where it is known, along with its fruit, by the name of Pitahaya. The yellow fruit has thorns, unlike the red dragon fruits (*H. undatus, H. polyrhizus, H. costaricensis*), and is commonly known as \"yellow dragon fruit\", \"yellow pitahaya\" or \"yellow pitaya\". [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hylocereus_megalanthus]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03414949 "Hylocereus megalanthus"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03414949 "yellow pitaya plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03414949 obo:FOODON_03412781)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03414949 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_1195127))

