AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414952 "Aronia arbutifolia, called the red chokeberry, is a North American species of shrubs in the rose family. Flowers are white or pink, producing black or bright red fruits. Many people consider the fruits to be foul-tasting. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aronia_arbutifolia]"@en)
