# Class: obo:FOODON_03414956 (blue honeysuckle plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414956 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414956 "Lonicera caerulea, the honeyberry, haskap berry, blue-berried honeysuckle, or sweetberry honeysuckle, is a honeysuckle native throughout the cool temperate Northern Hemisphere. The fruit is an edible, blue berry, somewhat rectangular in shape weighing 1.3 to 2.2 grams, and about 1 cm in diameter. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lonicera_caerulea]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414956 <http://eol.org/pages/486991>)
