AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414959 "Ribes divaricatum is a species of in the genus *Ribes* found in the forests, woodlands, and coastal scrub of western North America from British Columbia to California common names include coast black gooseberry, wild gooseberry and, in the UK, Worcesterberry [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ribes_divaricatum]"@en)
