AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414973 "Brassica carinata (Ethiopian rape, Ethiopian mustard, Abyssinian mustard) is a member of the Triangle of U species  in the agriculturally significant *Brassica* genus. The plant is also grown as a leaf vegetable, with a mild flavor. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brassica_carinata"@en)
