AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415001 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415001 "Tagetes tenuifolia, the signet marigold or golden marigold, is a species of the wild marigold in the daisy family (*Asteraceae*). It is widespread across most of Mexico as well as Central America, Colombia, and Peru. The plant's edible flowers can be used as a garnish. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tagetes_tenuifolia]"@en)
