AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415007 "Mentha aquatica (water mint; syn. *Mentha hirsuta* Huds.) is a perennial flowering plant in the mint family *Lamiaceae*. It grows in moist places and is native to much of Europe, northwest Africa and southwest Asia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentha_aquatica]"@en)
