AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415016 "Polypodium vulgare, the common polypody, is a fern of the *Polypodiaceae* family. Polypody has traditional uses in cooking for its aroma and sweet taste, and in herbal medicine as a purgative and vermifuge. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polypodium_vulgare]"@en)
