# Class: obo:FOODON_03415019 (manna ash plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415019 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415019 "Fraxinus ornus, the manna ash or South European flowering ash, is a species of Fraxinus native to southern Europe and southwestern Asia. A sugary extract from the sap is extracted by making a cut in the bark; this was compared in late medieval times with the biblical manna. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fraxinus_ornus]"@en)
