# Class: obo:FOODON_03415044 (trifoliate orange plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415044 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415044 "The trifoliate orange, *Citrus trifoliata* or *Poncirus trifoliata*, is a member of the family *Rutaceae* in the *Citrus* genus. It is native to northern China and Korea, and is also known as the Japanese bitter-orange, hardy orange or Chinese bitter orange. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trifoliate_orange]"@en)
