AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415048 "Pseudocydonia sinensis, the Chinese quince, is a deciduous or semi-evergreen tree in the family *Rosaceae*, native to eastern Asia in China, and the sole species in the genus *Pseudocydonia*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudocydonia]"@en)
