# Class: obo:FOODON_03415121 (buchu plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415121 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415121 "Agathosma betulina (previously *Barosma betulina*) is a flowering plant in the family *Rutaceae*, native to the lower elevation mountains of western South Africa, where it occurs near streams in fynbos habitats. It is known by the common name round leaf buchu and has historically been used as a flavoring agent and an herbal remedy. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agathosma_betulina]"@en)
