# Class: obo:FOODON_03415126 (common speedwell plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415126 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415126 "Veronica officinalis (heath speedwell, common gypsyweed, common speedwell, or Paul's betony) is a species of flowering plant in the plantain family *Plantaginaceae*. This speedwell grows in open areas, such as fields, meadows and gardens, where it is sometimes grown as an edible or medicinal herb. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Veronica_officinalis]"@en)
