AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415136 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415136 "Viola tricolor, Also known as Johnny Jump up (though this name is also applied to similar species such as the yellow pansy), heartsease, heart's ease, heart's delight, tickle-my-fancy, Jack-jump-up-and-kiss-me, come-and-cuddle-me, three faces in a hood, or love-in-idleness, is a common European wild flower, growing as an annual or short-lived perennial. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viola_tricolor]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03415136 <http://eol.org/pages/584541>)
