# Class: obo:FOODON_03415137 (heather plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415137 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415137 "Calluna vulgaris (known as common heather, ling, or simply heather) is the sole species in the genus *Calluna* in the flowering plant family *Ericaceae*. *Calluna vulgaris* herb has been used in the traditional Austrian medicine internally as tea for treatment of disorders of the kidneys and urinary tract. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calluna]"@en)
