AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415140 "Aesculus hippocastanum is a species of flowering plant in the soapberry and lychee family *Sapindaceae*. It is a large deciduous, synoecious (hermaphroditic-flowered) tree, commonly known as horse-chestnut or conker tree. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aesculus_hippocastanum]"@en)
