AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415141 "Sideritis, also known as ironwort, mountain tea and shepherd's tea, is a genus of flowering plants well known for their use as herbal medicine, commonly as an herbal tea. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sideritis]"@en)
