AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415150 "Herniaria glabra, known as smooth rupturewort, is a plant of the family *Caryophyllaceae*. Growing in North America and Europe. It contains herniarin, a methoxy analog of umbelliferone. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herniaria_glabra]"@en)
