# Class: obo:FOODON_03415169 (pink trumpet-tree plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415169 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415169 "Handroanthus impetiginosus, pink ipê, pink lapacho, or pink trumpet tree is a native tree of family *Bignoniaceae* of the Americas, distributed from northern Mexico south to northern Argentina. The inner bark of *Handroanthus impetiginosus* is used in traditional medicine. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handroanthus_impetiginosus]"@en)
