# Class: obo:FOODON_03415172 (soapbark plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415172 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415172 "Quillaja saponaria, the soap bark tree or soapbark, is an evergreen tree in the family *Quillajaceae, native to warm temperate central Chile. Soap bark tree has a long history of medicinal use with the Andean people who used it especially as a treatment for various chest problems. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quillaja_saponaria]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03415172 <http://eol.org/pages/241669>)
