AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03480017 "LanguaL curation note: Used for products that are packed in water or in water containing less than 4% salt, e.g., most canned vegetables. If a product normally packed in salted water is packed in salt free water, use *NO SALT ADDED CLAIM OR USE*."@en)
