AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03480020 "The medium in which the food is packed for preservation and handling or the medium surrounding homemade foods, e.g., peaches cooked in sugar syrup. The packing medium may provide a controlled environment for the food. It may also serve to improve palatability and consumer appeal."@en)
