AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510047 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510047 "All narrower term definitions extracted from 58 Federal Register 2032, January 6, 1993, part 101.61."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510047 langual:P0047)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510047 "sodium or salt special diet"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510047 "salt or sodium special claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510047 obo:FOODON_03510065)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510048 (high fiber food)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510048 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510048 "A claim that a food is high in fibre, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, may only be made where the product contains at least 6 g of fibre per 100 g or at least 3 g of fibre per 100 kcal [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18].

Food that is promoted as a source of or as high in dietary fiber (often called simply 'fiber')."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510048 langual:P0048)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510048 "high dietary fiber food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510048 "high fiber food"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510048 obo:FOODON_03510049)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510049 (fiber special claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510049 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510049 "Food that is promoted as being either high or low in dietary fiber (often called simply 'fiber'). If the food is not low in total fat, total fat must be stated in conjunction with claim such as 'more fiber'."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510049 langual:P0049)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510049 "dietary fiber special claim or use"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510049 "fiber special claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510049 obo:FOODON_03510065)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510054 (fat free food)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510054 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510054 "A claim that a food is fat-free, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, may only be made where the product contains no more than 0,5 g of fat per 100 g or 100 ml. However, claims expressed as \"X % fat-free\" shall be prohibited [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum].

Food having less than 0.5 grams fat per amount customarily consumed. Meals and main dishes have less than 0.5 grams fat per labeled serving. Such foods must contain no ingredient that is fat or understood to contain fat except when the ingredient listed has been footnoted '*adds a trivial amount of fat'."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510054 langual:P0054)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510054 "no fat food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510054 "nonfat food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510054 "fat free food"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510054 obo:FOODON_03510069)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510055 (energy free food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510055 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510055 "A claim that a food is energy-free, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, may only be made where the product does not contain more than 4 kcal (17 kJ)/100 ml. For table-top sweeteners the limit of 0.4 kcal (1.7 kJ)/portion, with equivalent sweetening properties to 6 g of sucrose (approximately 1 teaspoon of sucrose), applies [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18].

Food having less than 5 calories per amount customarily consumed. Calorie amount is not defined for meals or main dishes [US FDA]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510055 langual:P0055)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510055 "calorie free food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510055 "LanguaL curation note: Renamed from *CALORIE FREE FOOD* [LanguaL 2008]."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510055 "energy free food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510055 obo:FOODON_03510066)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510056 (sugars free food)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510056 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510056 "A claim that a food is sugars-free, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, may only be made where the product contains no more than 0,5 g of sugars per 100 g or 100 ml [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18].

Food having less than 0.5 grams sugars per amount customarily consumed (or for meals and main dishes, less than 0.5 grams sugars per labeled serving). Such foods nust contain no ingredient that is a sugar or generally understood to contain sugars except where the ingredient listed is footnoted '*adds a trivial amount of sugars' [US FDA]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510056 langual:P0056)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510056 "sugar free food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510056 "sugars free food"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510056 obo:FOODON_03510091)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510057 (low in saturated fat food)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510057 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510057 "A claim that a food is low in saturated fat, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, may only be made if the sum of saturated fatty acids and trans-fatty acids in the product does not exceed 1.5 g per 100 g for solids or 0.75 g/100 ml for liquids and in either case the sum of saturated fatty acids and trans-fatty acids must not provide more than 10 % of energy. [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18].

Food having one gram or less saturated fat per amount customarily consumed and 15% or less of calories from saturated fat. Meals and main dishes contain one gram or less saturated fat per 100 grams food and less than 10% of calories from saturated fat."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510057 langual:P0057)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510057 "low in saturated fat food"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510057 obo:FOODON_03510071)

