SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510127 obo:FOODON_03510126)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510128 (organic food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510128 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510128 "USA:
The 1990 Farm Act specifies that a food labeled 'organic' must meet four requirements:  1) the food must be raised by specified methods to replenish and maintain the fertility of the soil; 2) the food must be certified as having been produced with a nationally approved list of materials and practices; 3) to be eligible for certification at least three years must have elapsed between the first organic harvest and first use of nationally approved materials on land and crops;and 4) organic foods must meet all local, state and federal regulations governing the quality and safety of the food supply.

Europe:
Foods produced in accordance with Council Regulation (EC) No 834/2007
of 28 June 2007 on organic production and labelling of organic products and repealing Regulation (EEC) No 2092/91. [http://eur-lex.europa.eu/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=OJ:L:2007:189:0001:0023:EN:PDF]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510128 langual:P0128)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510128 "no pesticides claim or use"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510128 "organically grown label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510128 "organic food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510128 obo:FOODON_03510023)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510129 ("free" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510129 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510129 "Considerations include amounts that are 'nutritionally trivial' and amounts that can be declared as zero on the nutrition label. An additional criterion based on amount per weight (e.g., per 100 grams) is not considered necessary because the amount of nutrient in a 'free' food is so low that even frequent and repeated consumption is unlikely to have physiological consequences. (U.S. proposed)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510129 langual:P0129)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510129 "free, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510129 "\"free\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510129 obo:FOODON_03510059)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510130 ("high" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510130 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510130 "An amount customarily consumed contains 20% or more of the daily nutritional value to describe protein, vitamins, minerals, dietary fiber, or potassium. May be used on meals or main dishes to indicate that product contains a food that meets the definition."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510130 langual:P0130)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510130 "excellent source of label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510130 "high, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510130 "rich in label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510130 "\"high\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510130 obo:FOODON_03510059)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510131 ("less" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510131 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510131 langual:P0131)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510131 "less, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510131 "LanguaL curation note: Used on label comparison statements to describe foods having 25% or greater reductions in a nutrient. (U.S. proposed)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510131 "\"less\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510131 obo:FOODON_03510059)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510132 ("light" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510132 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510132 "A claim stating that a product is \"light\" or \"lite\", and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer, shall follow the same conditions as those set for the term \"reduced\", see *REDUCED {NAME OF NUTRIENT} NUTRITION CLAIM [P0132]*; the claim shall also be accompanied by an indication of the characteristic(s) which make(s) the food \"light\" or \"lite\" [REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18].

Used for foods that have 33.3% fewer calories than a comparable product and a minimum reduction of more than 40 calories per serving. Any other use of 'light' must specify whether it refers to the look, taste or smell; for example, 'light in color'. (U.S. FDA proposed)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510132 langual:P0132)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510132 "light, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510132 "\"light\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510132 obo:FOODON_03510059)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510133 ("more" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510133 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510133 langual:P0133)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510133 "more, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510133 "LanguaL curation note: Used in label comparison statement when a food contains at least 10% more of the daily nutritional value per amount customarily consumed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510133 "\"more\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510133 obo:FOODON_03510059)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510134 ("source of" label claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510134 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510134 langual:P0134)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "contains label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "contains, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "good source of label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "good source of, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "provides label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "provides, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510134 "source of, label claim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510134 "LanguaL curation note: The amount customarily consumed contains 10% to 19% of the daily nutritional value. May be used on meals or main dishes to indicate that product contains a food that meets the definition."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510134 "\"source of\" label claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510134 obo:FOODON_03510059)

