# Class: obo:FOODON_03510225 (food allergen labelling about sulphur dioxide and sulphites)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510225 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510225 "Sulphur dioxide and sulphites are included in the EU list of allergens
because they can cause adverse reactions in some people.

Regulated by Directive 2003/89/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 10 November 2003 amending Directive 2000/13/EC as regards indication of the ingredients present in foodstuffs."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510225 langual:P0225)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510225 "Sulphur dioxide and sulphites are included in the EU list of allergens
because they can cause adverse reactions in some people.

Regulated by Directive 2003/89/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 10 November 2003 amending Directive 2000/13/EC as regards indication of the ingredients present in foodstuffs.

LanguaL curation note: Used for sulphur dioxide and sulphites at concentrations of more than 10 mg/kg or 10 mg/litre expressed as SO2."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510225 "food allergen labelling about sulphur dioxide and sulphites"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510225 obo:FOODON_03510213)

