# Class: obo:FOODON_03510233 ("no trans fat" claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510233 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510233 langual:P0233)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510233 "LanguaL curation note: Under the new FDA regulations, by Jan. 1, 2006, consumers will be able to find trans fat listed on food nutrition labels directly under the line for saturated fat. The new information is the first significant change on the Nutrition Facts panel since it was established in 1993. 
Source: http://www.fda.gov/oc/initiatives/transfat/."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510233 "\"no trans fat\" claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510233 obo:FOODON_03510196)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510234 (traditional food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510234 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510234 "A food claim indicating that the product is frequently consumed or associated to specific celebrations and/or seasons, normally transmitted from one generation to another, made with care in a specific way according to the gastronomic heritage, with little or no processing/manipulation, that is distinguished and known because of its sensory properties and associated to a certain local area, region or country."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03510234 <http://www.truefood.eu/>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510234 langual:P0234)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510234 "\"Traditional\" means proven usage on the Community market for a time period showing transmission between generations; this time period should be the one generally ascribed to one human generation, at least 25 years [COUNCIL REGULATION (EC) No 509/2006 of 20 March 2006 on agricultural products and foodstuffs as traditional specialities guaranteed].

Traditional means conforming to established practice or specifications prior to the Second World War. Traditional food is a food of a specific feature or features, which distinguish it clearly from other similar products of the same category in terms of the use of traditional ingredients (raw materials or primary products), traditional composition or traditional type of production and/or processing method. [Traditional Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 6, 2009]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510234 "traditional food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510234 obo:FOODON_03510126)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510235 (ethnic food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510235 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510235 "Ethnic food is food from countries other than the home market contributing to a different food culture than the traditional cuisine of the host country. [Ethnic Groups and Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 3, 2005]

\"Ethnic food\" has been used colloquially for a wide variety of foodstuffs, virtually any that can be identified in the public mind with a foreign source or an ethnic minority group. In the narrower ethnographic meaning, it pertains only to food prepared or consumed by members of an ethnic group as a manifestation of its ethnicity. In the end ethnic food is food that members of an ethnic group consider their own and that others attribute to them. [http://www.answers.com/topic/ethnic-cuisines]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510235 langual:P0235)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510235 "ethnic food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510235 obo:FOODON_03510126)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510236 (traditional ingredient claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510236 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510236 "Raw material (species and/or varieties) or primary product either alone or as an ingredient that has been used in identifiable geographical areas and remains in use today (taking into account cases where use was abandoned for a time and then reinstated) and its characteristics are in accordance with current specifications of national and EU legislation. [Traditional Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 6, 2009]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510236 langual:P0236)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510236 "LanguaL curation note: Use when \"Traditional ingredients\" is claimed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510236 "traditional ingredient claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510236 obo:FOODON_03510234)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510237 (traditional composition claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510237 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510237 "The uniquely identifiable composition (in terms of ingredients) that was first established prior to the Second World War and passed down through generations by oral or other means (taking into account cases where composition was abandoned for a time and then reinstated) and when necessary is differentiated from the composition defined by the generally recognized characteristics of the wider food group to which the product belongs. [Traditional Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 6, 2009]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510237 langual:P0237)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510237 "LanguaL curation note: Use when \"Traditional composition\" is claimed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510237 "traditional composition claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510237 obo:FOODON_03510234)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510238 (traditional type of production and/or processing claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510238 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510238 "The production and/or processing of a food that has been transmitted from generation to generation through oral tradition or other means and has been applied prior to the Second World War and remains in use (taking into account cases where composition was abandoned for a time and then reinstated) despite its adjustment to binding rules from national or EU food hygiene regulations or the incorporation of technological progress, under the condition that production and/or processing remains in line with methods used originally and that the food's intrinsic features such as its physical, chemical, microbiological or organoleptic features are maintained. [Traditional Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 6, 2009]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510238 langual:P0238)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510238 "LanguaL curation note: Use when \"Traditional type of production and/or processing\" is claimed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510238 "traditional type of production and/or processing claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510238 obo:FOODON_03510234)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510239 (authentic ethnic food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510239 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510239 "Authentic ethnic food is food from countries other than the home market contributing to a different food culture than the traditional cuisine of the host country. Food may be adapted by combining local and imported ingredients. [Ethnic Groups and Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 3, 2005]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510239 langual:P0239)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510239 "authentic ethnic food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510239 obo:FOODON_03510235)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510240 (modified ethnic food claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510240 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510240 "Modified ethnic food: a commercially-available version of a food that has been modified to suit the taste and preference of the host country. [Ethnic Groups and Foods in Europe, EuroFIR Synthesis report No 3, 2005]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510240 langual:P0240)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510240 "modified ethnic food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510240 obo:FOODON_03510235)

