# Class: obo:FOODON_03530050 (fruit ripeness)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03530050 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03530050 "A food plant physical characteristic about the ripening stage of development of a fruit."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03530050 langual:Z0050)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03530050 "Ripeness entails safety, nutrient composition and consumption characteristics.

This term was revised (Aug 4, 2022) from LanguaL's original \"degree of plant maturity\" label and its \"plant or plant part\" scope, which leaned heavily toward a fruit-oriented sense.  (LanguaL curation note: Use the appropriate narrower term only if ripeness is stated in the food name or label.)  FoodOn now has a separate class for plant maturity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03530050 "fruit ripeness"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03530050 obo:FOODON_03530268)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03530051 (unripe)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03530051 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03530051 "A fruit ripeness characteristic in which a fruit has not achieved full maturity and is not slightly ripe."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:FOODON_03530051 "immature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03530051 langual:Z0051)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03530051 "This condition does not necessarily preclude utilization, for example, green tomatoes are consumed despite their relative unripeness to red tomatoes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03530051 "unripe"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03530051 obo:FOODON_03530050)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03530052 (ripe)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03530052 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03530052 "A fruit ripeness characteristic in which a fruit has achieved full maturity and is ready for utilization."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:FOODON_03530052 "mature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03530052 langual:Z0052)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03530052 "mature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03530052 "LanguaL curation note: Use only if ripeness is stated in the food name or label."@en)
