# Class: obo:FOODON_03530218 (food packing medium integrity)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:FOODON_03530218 "A can of peaches in syrup, in which the syrup is uncompromised."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03530218 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03530218 "A food object quality which describes the integrity of the medium in which the food is packed for preservation and handling or the medium surrounding foods."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:FOODON_03530218 "Previous definition was a legacy definition, not ontological and has been moved to comments. Updated examples of usage to remove plastic usage as describes packaging not packing medium."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:FOODON_03530218 "http://orcid.org/0000-0001-8008-8249")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03530218 langual:Z0218)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03530218 "Previous definition: It is important to distinguish whether the food in question has been drained or not drained when evaluating the nutrient content.
Related term to PRESENCE OF PACKING MEDIUM is K.  PACKING MEDIUM."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03530218 "food packing medium integrity"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03530218 obo:FOODON_00002470)

