AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03530251 "GMO"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03530251 "LanguaL curation note: 'Genetically modified food' means food containing, consisting of or produced from GMOs - in accordance with REGULATION (EC) No 1829/2003 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL of 22 September 2003 on genetically modified food and feed."@en)
