AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3712 "Kale or borecole is a form of cabbage (*Brassica oleracea* Acephala Group), green or purple, in which the central leaves do not form a head."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:NCBITaxon_3712 "Damion Dooley"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_3712 <http://eol.org/pages/583899>)
