AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03412738 "An edible mushroom in the family Boletaceae, and was formerly classified as Boletus scaber. The birch bolete is widespread in Europe, in the Himalayas in Asia, and elsewhere in the Northern Hemisphere"@en)
